  <title>Mailing lists</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Edit</gui><gui>Mailing lists</gui></guiseq> keeps the names
  of your mailing lists. Changes are saved as you make them.</p>

  <list>
    <item><p><gui>Add</gui> makes a list called <gui>New mailing list</gui>;
    click its <gui>Name</gui> to rename it.</p></item>
    <item><p><gui>Deactivate</gui> retires the selected list.</p></item>
    <item><p>Check <gui>Auto add</gui> to put every contact brought in with
    <link xref="data_import">contact import</link> on that list.</p></item>
  </list>

  <p>To print a list's addresses, use <link
  xref="mailing_list_printing"/>.</p>

</page>
